 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Tool executors now receive only input accepted by their declared JSON Schema. Invalid static schemas
+  fail during registration, while rejected calls return a validation result that the model can correct.
+  Migration: executors that hand-validated input can remove that duplication; executors that relied on
+  seeing malformed input to produce a custom error no longer receive those calls.
+
